#### 패키지 Graphics


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
plot(density(rnorm(100)))
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](density-plot_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-1-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
dens <- density(rnorm(100))
plot(dens)
polygon(dens, col = "Yellow", border = "Yellow")
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](density-plot_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-2-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


#### 패키지 ggplot2


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
library(ggplot2)
ggplot(data.frame(val = rnorm(100)), aes(x = val)) +
  geom_density()
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](density-plot_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-3-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
library(ggplot2)
ggplot(data.frame(val = rnorm(100)), aes(x = val)) +
  geom_density(fill = "Yellow", alpha = 0.3)
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](density-plot_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-4-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::
